msgid ""
"MeowMenu is a panel-plugin launcher for the Xfce desktop. It is a standalone "
"project that originated as a fork of Xfce's Whisker Menu and keeps the "
"familiar panel-launcher feel while bringing a cleaner modern look and a more "
"capable search bar."
